<item><title>Cameroon&apos;s 2025 budget deficit reaches CFA535 billion</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-s-2025-budget-deficit-reaches-cfa535-billion-dc487f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-s-2025-budget-deficit-reaches-cfa535-billion-dc487f/</guid><category>Cameroon</category><description>Revenue fell CFA176 billion short of projections while spending exceeded forecasts, widening the deficit by 72.7%.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 19:07:54 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-s-2025-budget-deficit-reaches-cfa535-billion-dc487f/share.jpg" length="42829" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-s-2025-budget-deficit-reaches-cfa535-billion-dc487f/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
